# Disable PHP Script Execution in Uploads Directory
<FilesMatch "\.(php|phtml|php3|php4|php5|php7|phps|exe|pl|py|sh|cgi)$">
    Order Deny,Allow
    Deny from all
</FilesMatch>

# Force Plain Serving for Uploaded Assets
RemoveHandler .php .phtml .php3 .php4 .php5 .php7
RemoveType .php .phtml .php3 .php4 .php5 .php7
php_flag engine off
